OL,3,CMan dies after being struck by road
OL,4,Csweeper
OL,6,FA man has died after being struck by a
OL,7,Froad sweeper, police have confirmed.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FCleggs Lane, in Salford, at 8:15am on
OL,11,FTuesday, 28 July 2026, following
OL,12,Freports of a serious collision between
OL,13,Fa vehicle and a pedestrian.
OL,15,FThe 64-year-old was rushed to hospital
OL,16,Fwith life-threatening injuries, but
OL,17,Fdied later the same afternoon.
OL,19,FThe driver of the road sweeper, a 39-
OL,20,Fyear-old man, was uninjured in the
OL,21,Fincident.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
