OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785415712
OL,3,CMan dies after being struck by road
OL,4,Csweeper
OL,6,FOfficers from Greater Manchester
OL,7,FPolice's Serious Collision
OL,8,FInvestigation Unit (SCIU) have
OL,9,Flaunched an investigation into the
OL,10,Fcircumstances surrounding the crash
OL,11,Fand are asking members of the public
OL,12,Ffor help.
OL,14,FDetectives are appealing for anyone
OL,15,Fwho witnessed the collision, or who
OL,16,Fmay have captured the incident on
OL,17,Fcamera, to get in touch immediately.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
