OL,3,CMan dies after being struck by road
OL,4,Csweeper
OL,6,FInvestigators are specifically looking
OL,7,Ffor witnesses who were in the Cleggs
OL,8,FLane area around 8:15am, and anyone
OL,9,Fwho has dash-cam, CCTV or doorbell
OL,10,Ffootage of the incident.
